        <activityName xml:lang="en">Glass, from public collection, unsorted</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Glass, from public collection, unsorted
A production site with a production amount of 3 times 250 t/d (resulting in 266 kt per year) and a total life span of 50 a is assumed here.;
UUID: 3a36045b-fc25-3ecc-8d54-00ed5a29f230
This module includes the transportation efforts for the collection as well as the fruther transportation to the next glass production site / glass sorting plant. No further efforts are included into this module.
Location: module contains assumptions of the author,  based on information about the Swiss situation, valuable for European conditions
Technology: An average European situation with public collection points is assumed for this module.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3a36045b-fc25-3ecc-8d54-00ed5a29f230.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
